# Play test of the plan 'Silver Screen Seas' (CIPlay plan_silver_screen, in a test world 'CI ...'): Raft's story from its
# start with Raft's own notes read as the game does; after each story island the plan's themed island must come on the
# Receiver, be played to its end with its own test, and lead on to the next - and the side trips, sailed to.
plan Silver Screen Seas
note RadioTower
expect chain RadioTower unlocked
expect chain blackwater locked

# RadioTower's note leads to the plan's island first, its quest to Vasagatan
note Vasagatan
expect chain blackwater unlocked
tune blackwater
include camp_blackwater.play
expect chain blackwater done
expect chain Vasagatan unlocked

# Vasagatan's note leads to the plan's island first, its quest to Balboa
note Balboa
expect chain liner unlocked
tune liner
include sunken_liner.play
expect chain liner done
expect chain Balboa unlocked

# Balboa's note leads to the plan's island first, its quest to CaravanTown
note CaravanTown
expect chain pyramid unlocked
tune pyramid
include step_pyramid.play
expect chain pyramid done
expect chain CaravanTown unlocked

# CaravanTown's note leads to the plan's island first, its quest to Tangaroa
note Tangaroa
expect chain arena unlocked
tune arena
include the_arena.play
expect chain arena done
expect chain Tangaroa unlocked

# Tangaroa's note leads to the plan's island first, its quest to VarunaPoint
note VarunaPoint
expect chain airfield unlocked
tune airfield
include albatross_field.play
expect chain airfield done
expect chain VarunaPoint unlocked

# VarunaPoint's note leads to the plan's island first, its quest to Temperance
note Temperance
expect chain stations unlocked
tune stations
include island_of_stations.play
expect chain stations done
expect chain Temperance unlocked

# Temperance's note: Primeval Park, then Sundown Canyons, then Utopia - the end of Raft's story
note Utopia
expect chain park unlocked
tune park
include primeval_park.play
expect chain park done
expect chain sundown unlocked
tune sundown
include sundown_canyons.play
expect chain sundown done
expect chain Utopia unlocked

# The side trips: the normal-size themed islands come ahead of the raft while it sails (at 2 to 32 km), each played to
# its end
sail 2
arrive tiki
include tiki_lagoon.play
sail 2
arrive gilded
include gilded_skull_cove.play
sail 3
arrive labyrinth
include drowned_labyrinth.play
sail 3
arrive keeper
include keepers_light.play
sail 3
arrive embers
include embers_isle.play
sail 3
arrive saferoom
include the_safe_room.play
sail 4
arrive sunatoll
include sun_atoll.play
sail 4
arrive rockpen
include the_rock_pen.play
sail 4
arrive highmoor
include highmoor_lodge.play
sail 4
arrive crater
include crater_lair.play
expect blueprints
plan end
